# Power loss around sequence allocation
name: power-loss-sequence
version: 1
description: Power loss after sequence reservation but before append; gap created, no duplicate.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read CHIP-001
crash_identity_store 1
read CHIP-002
reboot
assert observations 1
assert next_sequence 3
assert observation 0 sequence 1
read CHIP-002
assert observations 2
assert next_sequence 4
assert observation 1 sequence 3
assert sequences_unique
assert sequences_monotonic